OL,3,AExecution of US murderer Christa Pike
OL,4,Ahalted shortly before it was due to
OL,5,Ahappen
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis latest ruling comes after the
OL,8,FSupreme Court denied a reprieve and the
OL,9,FTennessee governor declined to grant
OL,10,FPike's request for clemency earlier
OL,11,Fthis week.
